==Miscellaneous==
*Added 2 new [[User Rank]] Rewards:
**1,450 grants 3 new [[Cat Combo]]s.
**2,150 grants 3 new [[Cat Combo]]s.
*Added 2 new Abilities:
**'''[[Long Distance]]''' (遠方攻撃): Units with this ability have a minimum range and a maximum range. Any foe between those two points will get hit by this unit's attack. The points can be any positive number greater than 0, completely independant of the unit's range stat. Against [[Enemy Bases]], this unit will stand at its minimum range.
**'''[[Immune to Waves]]''' (波動ダメージ無効): Units with this ability cannot take damage from [[Wave Attack]]s.
*Added 10-second Energy recovery when exiting a battle.
*Fixed a bug where [[Into the Future#The Ancients Arise: Take Back Earth!|The Ancients Arise: Take Back Earth!]] didn't appear.

